# Bulk source material (the WCAG spec, vendor PDFs) stays out of the repo;
# distillations of it written for this project are tracked. Must exclude the
# directory's *contents*, not the directory — git never descends into an
# excluded directory, which would make the negation below inert.
reference/*
!reference/*.md
.screenshots/
